        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6600K, AMD 1600X or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050; AMD Radeon 7950, or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> On &quot;Low&quot; graphics settings, the game is playable with older hardware including recent integrated graphics CPUs.</li></ul>",
        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 10th Gen, AMD Zen3, or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX-class, AMD 6700-class or better for &quot;High&quot; graphics settings<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Built in Unreal Engine 5, the game can be a graphically intense game at higher resolutions and quality settings.</li></ul>"
